From: Erik Faye-Lund <erik.faye-lund@arm.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:42:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/17] pan/lib: fix repeated width_px check

The second width_px should have been height_px. Classic.

Fixes: 5fc91b38c84c ("pan/fb: Add a mapping to the old FB info")
CID: 1691016
Reviewed-by: Boris Brezillon <boris.brezillon@collabora.com>
(cherry picked from commit 457b68876353dc169c476eb223c0171dbef8c8ae)

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45704>
(cherry picked from commit 4a1f9b6c10660889a7d32ae2ebd4ed84ce71b329)
---
 src/panfrost/lib/pan_fb.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/panfrost/lib/pan_fb.c b/src/panfrost/lib/pan_fb.c
index f2e93979ff5..b3239a972e1 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/lib/pan_fb.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/lib/pan_fb.c
@@ -275,7 +275,7 @@ GENX(pan_fill_fb_info)(const struct pan_fb_desc_info *info,
                        struct pan_fb_info *fbinfo)
 {
    struct pan_bbox bbox = { 0, 0, 0, 0 };
-   if (info->fb->width_px > 0 && info->fb->width_px > 0) {
+   if (info->fb->width_px > 0 && info->fb->height_px > 0) {
       const struct pan_fb_bbox fb_area_px =
          pan_fb_bbox_from_xywh(0, 0, info->fb->width_px, info->fb->height_px);
 
